{
  "name": "Black Mirror Bike Ride",
  "short_name": "Bike Ride",
  "description": "A homebrew alternative to Zwift — BLE-powered indoor cycling sim with virtual and GPX-imported real-world routes. Runs entirely in your browser; your rides stay on your device.",
